===Adjective===
{{head|en|superlative adjective}}

# {{en-superlative of|far}}
## [[most|Most]] [[distant]] in [[time]], [[space]] or [[degree]].
##: ''The '''furthest''' known galaxy is about 13 billion light years from Earth.''

